OL,3,GNEWSAFire at proposed asylum seeker
OL,4,Ahousing treated as arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire at an empty building earmarked
OL,7,Ffor use as asylum seeker accommodation
OL,8,Fis being investigated as arson, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fwas called to Roman Court, a former
OL,13,Fsheltered housing complex in
OL,14,FLeverington, at 19:26 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe fire service said six crews had
OL,17,Fbeen "working hard" to tackle the blaze
OL,18,Fand prevent it from spreading.
OL,20,FAn investigation will be carried out to
OL,21,Festablish the exact cause of the fire
OL,22,Fonce it is fully extinguished, it said.
